.Dd August 22, 2026
.Dt MAC_GENERIC_GROK 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm mac_generic_grok
.Nd stage and revert orthogonal
.Xr mac 4
modules
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
loads kernel modules other than
.Xr mac_lomac 4
.Pq e.g. Xr mac_seeotheruids 4
from a
.Pa POLICIES
list.
It does not take
.Xr zfs 8
snapshots;
.Xr mac_grok 8
does that for the suite.
.Pp
.Va mac_generic_grok_enable
defaults to
.Dq NO .
Use
.Xr service 8
.Dq one Ns Ar command .
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width uninstall
.It Cm install
Install under
.Pa /usr/local
including manuals.
.It Cm stage
Config
.Pa PREINSTALL
then marked
.Xr loader.conf 5
stanzas.
.It Cm update , Cm reload
Rewrite stanzas from
.Pa POLICIES
without a new snapshot.
.It Cm start , Cm stop , Cm status
.Xr kldload 8
or
.Xr kldunload 8
each listed module.
.It Cm uninstall
Restore
.Pa PREINSTALL ,
unload modules, remove
.Pa /usr/local
files including manuals.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Pa
.It Pa /usr/local/etc/mac_generic_grok/POLICIES
One module name per line
.Pq no
.Dq mac_
prefix :
.Dq seeotheruids ,
.Dq ifoff ,
.Dq portacl ,
.Dq bsdextended .
.It Pa /var/db/mac_generic_grok/PREINSTALL
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mac_generic_grok 4 ,
.Xr mac_generic_grok 5 ,
.Xr mac_seeotheruids 4 ,
.Xr mac_ifoff 4 ,
.Xr mac_portacl 4 ,
.Xr mac_bsdextended 4 ,
.Xr mac_grok 8
.Sh BUGS
See the package
.Pa README
section
.Dq Known issues
for Handbook ch.19 and mailing-list notes
.Pq ifoff lockout, seeotheruids vs root, single specificgid, ugidfw reload .
